build 1025 — v1.2.0 release (2026-07-31). Everything since 1024 (v1.1.1, 29 Jul):
  * Feed: broadcast + never-repeat. All public posts eligible (no 48h window, no
    370-post cap), unseen-first with fewest-viewers-first fairness, recycling
    fallback so the feed never ends, no same-author back-to-back.
  * Stories (24h): public to the whole community (was follows-only), ordered
    newest-first, and the author sees a VIEW COUNT (number only, no names).
  * Feed posts: "Add friend" button on Suggested posts (sends request + follows).
  * /friends: new "Awaited" tab for received requests (accept one by one);
    "Pending" now shows only requests you sent.
  * Notifications: comment/reaction notifications open the exact post; friend
    requests open the Awaited list. Shared link map used by bell + push.
  * PUSH NOTIFICATIONS (new): device registers on login, DB trigger fires
    send-push on every notification, tap deep-links into the app, per-user
    push_* preferences, unregister on logout.
  * "Photo of the Day" renamed to "The Curated Wall" everywhere (text only).
  * Admin Gallery: free-text photo category (custom names flow to home page).
  * Fixes: first-visit blank page + sticky ?cb= param from the cache-buster;
    entry-bundle cache-bust marker so deploys can no longer serve stale code.
